  "ruleText": "Saf-C 220.02 Notice. The board shall cause to be published in the New Hampshire Rulemaking Register a notice of its intent to hold a rulemaking hearing pursuant to RSA 541-A:6.\n\nSource. #8230-A, eff 12-17-04 (formerly Saf-C 218.02, renumbered by #8544); (formerly Saf-C 219.02, renumbered by #9724)",
